### ===================================================================
### InternShield REST API Testing File (VS Code REST Client / Postman)
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & SESSION ENDPOINTS
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Register a new student
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Viva Test Student",
  "email": "test.student@college.edu",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "role": "student",
  "skills": ["React", "JavaScript", "Node.js", "Git"],
  "targetRole": "Web Developer"
}

### Login with student credentials
# @name loginStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "aarav.sharma@college.edu",
  "password": "Student@123"
}

### Login with admin credentials
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "admin@internshield.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Get current logged-in user profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Update student profile (skills, education, target role)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "targetRole": "Frontend Developer",
  "skills": ["React", "JavaScript", "TypeScript", "HTML5", "CSS3", "Tailwind CSS", "Git"],
  "education": {
    "institution": "IIIT Bengaluru",
    "degree": "B.Tech CSE",
    "graduationYear": 2026
  }
}

### Logout current session
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. INTERNSHIPS CRUD & FILTERING
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### List internships (with search, filter, pagination, and HATEOAS URL building)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internships?search=React&mode=hybrid&minStipend=20000&verified=true&page=1&limit=5&sort=newest

### Get single internship by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/internships/6adc80d95232119805d45125

### Create internship (Requires Admin Session)
POST {{baseUrl}}/internships
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Full Stack Cloud Intern",
  "company": "Amazon Web Services",
  "description": "Develop automated deployment pipelines using Docker, React, and Node.js.",
  "requiredSkills": ["Docker", "React", "Node.js", "AWS"],
  "location": "Hyderabad, India",
  "stipend": 45000,
  "mode": "hybrid",
  "applyLink": "https://amazon.jobs",
  "recruiterEmail": "aws-campus@amazon.com",
  "recruiterPhone": "04044556677",
  "verified": true,
  "trustScore": 99
}

### Update internship (Requires Admin Session)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/internships/6adc80d95232119805d45125
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "stipend": 38000
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. FAKE INTERNSHIP DETECTOR
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Analyze a scam offer (Demands security fee, gmail recruiter, unrealistic stipend)
POST {{baseUrl}}/detector/analyze
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "text": "Work from home 2 hours daily! Earn up to Rs 65,000 per month without any prior coding experience. Pay refundable security deposit of Rs 1,499. Apply within 24 hours, limited seats remaining. Contact WhatsApp only at 9876543210 immediately.",
  "company": "Apex Global Solutions Ltd",
  "recruiterEmail": "hr.careers123@gmail.com",
  "recruiterPhone": "9876543210",
  "link": "https://bit.ly/apex-scam-intern",
  "stipend": 65000
}

### Analyze a legitimate corporate internship offer
POST {{baseUrl}}/detector/analyze
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "text": "Join our merchant checkout team to build responsive, accessible web interfaces in React and TypeScript. Collaborate with senior designers and backend engineers.",
  "company": "Razorpay Software",
  "recruiterEmail": "campus-hiring@razorpay.com",
  "recruiterPhone": "08046669999",
  "link": "https://razorpay.com/jobs/frontend-intern",
  "stipend": 35000
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. RESUME BUILDER & ATS TAILOR
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Analyze Resume against Job Description for ATS compatibility
POST {{baseUrl}}/resume/analyze
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "jobDescription": "Looking for React Frontend Developer Intern with hands-on skills in React, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, REST API, Git, and Docker. Experience with Node.js is a plus.",
  "resumeData": {
    "summary": "Computer science student building full stack web applications in React and Node.js.",
    "skills": ["React", "JavaScript", "HTML", "CSS", "Git", "Python"],
    "projects": [
      {
        "title": "InternShield Web Portal",
        "technologies": "React, CSS, Node.js",
        "description": "Built scam detection tools and verified job matching."
      }
    ],
    "experience": [],
    "education": [
      { "institution": "Tech University", "degree": "B.Tech CSE" }
    ]
  }
}

### Tailor Resume to Job Description (Reorders skills & projects by match)
POST {{baseUrl}}/resume/tailor
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "jobDescription": "We need a Node.js, Express, Docker, and REST API engineer.",
  "resumeData": {
    "skills": ["HTML", "CSS", "Docker", "Node.js", "Express.js", "Photoshop"],
    "projects": [
      { "title": "Design Portfolio", "technologies": "Photoshop, HTML", "description": "Graphics design." },
      { "title": "Microservices API", "technologies": "Node.js, Docker, Express", "description": "High performance backend." }
    ]
  }
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. RECOMMENDATIONS & MATCH ENGINE
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get verified recommendations matched against logged-in student's skills
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommend


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. RECRUITER FRAUD CHECK & REPORTING
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Check recruiter email against approved fraud reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/check?type=email&value=hr.careers123@gmail.com

### Check recruiter phone against approved fraud reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/check?type=phone&value=9876543210

### Submit a new fraud report (Requires Student Session)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "type": "email",
  "value": "recruiter.fakejobs@gmail.com",
  "reason": "Demanded ₹2,000 document verification fee via Google Pay."
}

### Get user's submitted reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/mine


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. SKILL GAP ANALYZER & COURSES
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Analyze skill gap for Web Developer role
GET {{baseUrl}}/skillgap?role=Web%20Developer

### Analyze skill gap for DevOps Engineer role
GET {{baseUrl}}/skillgap?role=DevOps%20Engineer


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. AUTOMATED ALERTS
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get alerts for logged-in user
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts

### Get only unread alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts?unread=true

### Mark all alerts as read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/alerts/read-all


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. SYLLABUS LAB EXPERIMENTS DEMO ENDPOINTS (Exp 1-3, 6, 11)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Exp 1a: Defining & Handling routes
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/hello

### Exp 3a: Route parameters (req.params)
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/users/42

### Exp 3b: Query parameters (req.query)
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/search?q=nodejs&limit=3

### Exp 3c: URL Building with Web URL API
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/url-building

### Exp 1b: HTTP POST to in-memory resource
POST {{baseUrl}}/demo/items
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Express Middleware Masterclass",
  "category": "Backend"
}

### Exp 1b: HTTP GET in-memory resource
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/items

### Exp 1b: HTTP DELETE in-memory resource
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/demo/items/1

### Exp 6: Route-level middleware (checkApiKey) - Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/protected-by-key

### Exp 6: Route-level middleware (checkApiKey) - Authorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/protected-by-key?key=demo-secret-key

### Exp 11: Set Cookie
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/set-cookie

### Exp 11: Read Cookie
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/read-cookie

### Exp 11: Clear Cookie
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/clear-cookie

### Exp 11: Session View Counter
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/visits

### Error-Handling Middleware demonstration (returns 418 TeaPot)
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/trigger-error
